      "writtenOn": "2023-02-02T03:04:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It still can reproduce b/262663436 #comment1 issue by using new FW (include CL:4211348), so we upload this patch want to fix it.\n \nCOMPARATOR and ACOK bits status are different when unplug AC from hub(b/262663436 #comment22 EC_0130_2.log) \n```\n23-01-30 17:53:23.867 ec:~$ [1462.993100 C0: DPM Waiting]                       \u003c\u003d\u003d unplug AC from hub\n23-01-30 17:53:23.872 ec:~$ I: New chg p0\n23-01-30 17:53:23.900 W: Skip enable p0\n23-01-30 17:53:23.903 I: New chg p-1\n...\n23-01-30 17:53:24.676 ec:~$ ISL9238_REG_INFO2: 0x69C9\n23-01-30 17:53:24.925 ec:~$ port: 0 , acok: 1 , rv: 0\n23-01-30 17:53:24.928 ec:~$ raa489000_check_ac_delayed: start\n23-01-30 17:53:24.932 ec:~$ regval: 0x69C9 \n23-01-30 17:53:24.936 ec:~$ current_val: 0 \n23-01-30 17:53:24.938 ec:~$ new_val: 1 \n23-01-30 17:53:24.939 ec:~$ isl923x_set_comparator_inversion\n23-01-30 17:53:24.943 ec:~$ raa489000_check_ac_delayed: end\n23-01-30 17:53:24.946 ec:~$ ISL9238_REG_INFO2: 0x49C9\n23-01-30 17:53:25.178 ec:~$ port: 0 , acok: 1 , rv: 0\n```\n0x49C9 \u003d\u003e ACOK(bit_14): is 1, COMPARATOR (bit_13) is 0, state machine(bit8-11) is OTG mode\n\nAnd we just want to follow CL:4179436 design(Support AC_PRESENT when OTG mode), so using comparator bit to be acok state instead of acok bit when OTG mode.",
      "parentUuid": "3918a957_c6b6f0d4",
      "revId": "420ffc344e6f573065049aa133d308951b911675",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
